sentences.l:
‘Ah! Truly, very much, the offspring of Atreus, far-thundering Zeus
terribly hated, because of women’s plans,
from the beginning;

and a child was to her at the breast,
an infant, who somewhere now at least among men sits in the count,
prosperous;

‘O Achilles, son of Peleus, by far the best of the Achaeans,
I came, for need of Tiresias, whether any plan
he might tell, how to rugged Ithaca I might come;

for before, indeed, you living we honoured equally with gods,
we Argives, and now again greatly you hold sway among the dead,
here being;

for I am no helper beneath the rays of the sun,
being such as (I was) when once in broad Troy
I killed the best host, defending the Argives;

‘Truly, of blameless Peleus I have learned nothing,
but of the child, dear Neoptolemus,
the whole truth I will tell, as you bid me;

But that one never at all did I see with my eyes
either turned pale in his fair skin, nor from his cheeks
a tear wiping away;
